### 1. Get all General Ledger lines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/general-ledger/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Filter by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/general-ledger/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Filter by account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/general-ledger/?account_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Filter by source module
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/general-ledger/?source=invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Filter by account type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/general-ledger/?type=asset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Search journal number, account, or description
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/general-ledger/?search=invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Combine filters and pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/general-ledger/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-14&account_id=1&source=invoice&type=asset&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}